Remember the difference:
@ValueMapValue → reads a property.
@ChildResource → accesses a child resource/node.
The name in @ChildResource is the repository child-node name, not an HTL variable name or Java method name.

@SlingObject
Meaning: Injects Sling objects such as a ResourceResolver, Resource, or SlingHttpServletRequest.

Run logic after injection @PostConstruct
Access a request attribute @RequestAttribute
Read a URL/form parameter @RequestParameter
Set a default property value @Default
Register an OSGi component @Component
Connect an OSGi service @Reference
Initialize an OSGi component @Activate
Handle configuration changes @Modified
Define OSGi configuration @Designate, @ObjectClassDefinition
Export a Sling Model @Exporter
